k08SetFeedback(130,"This has close to the opposite effect we wanted. When playing the full interview, viewers are treated to the part where you say Bill Maher should be your running mate. It's clear that part was a joke, but it just further feeds the narrative that you're unrealistic and not serious.");
k08SetFeedback(131,"Over-explaining this may minimize the damage among the minority of Americans who actually care to hear your response, but the clip is still killing us with most Americans.");
